  "id": "section-969",
  "title": "对庆祝国庆的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-349.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>349)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　今年的国庆要充分的宣传文化大革命的成就。<br>\n<br>\n<p>×　　　×　　　×</p>\n<br>\n　　游行不单是游行，也是大批判。用文艺武器批判党内最大的走资本主义道路当权派。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-348.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-350.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
